  "type": "data_contract",
  "title": "Every emitted SensorReading conforms to its schema",
  "statement": "Every SensorReading emitted by any devai sense command \u2014 and by the buildSensorReading helper used to construct one \u2014 MUST validate against sensor-reading.schema.json before leaving the emitting process.",
  "rationale": "The SensorReading envelope is the uniform interface every downstream consumer (scorecard, triage, skills) depends on. Article 32 makes the envelope the contract; silent drift in shape would mean Phase 6 + 8 receive payloads they think they understand but don't. Schema-invalid emit is a hard-gate failure (Article 17).",
  "status": "active",
